  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 200 degrees Celsius.",
    "In a large bowl, combine the cubed beef, potatoes, carrots, onion, garlic, smoked paprika, thyme, salt, and pepper.",
    "Drizzle the sake over the mixture and toss to coat evenly.",
    "Place the seasoned ingredients onto a large sheet of parchment paper.",
    "Sprinkle the butter pieces over the top of the mixture.",
    "Fold the parchment over the ingredients to seal into a papillote pouch.",
    "Bake the papillote in the preheated oven for 45 minutes, or until the beef is tender and vegetables are cooked.",
    "Remove from the oven and carefully open the pouch, letting steam escape.",
    "Transfer the contents to a bowl, fold in the sour cream and chopped dill, and serve hot."
  ],
